==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|апоте́ка|опте́ка||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|zle-mru|аптека}}, from {{der|ru|zle-ort|аптека}}, from Middle {{der|ru|pl|apteka}} (16th c.). Perhaps from {{cog|zlw-opl|apoteka}} (att. 1484) and {{cog|gmh|apothēke}}, but more likely from {{der|ru|gml|abteke}}. Either way, from {{der|ru|la|apothēca|t=repository}} and from {{der|ru|grc|ἀποθήκη}}, itself from {{m|grc|ἀποτίθημι|t=to put away}}, from {{m|grc|ἀπο-|t=away}} + {{m|grc|τίθημι|t=to put}}. Ultimately from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*h₂epó}} and {{m|ine-pro|*dʰédʰeh₁ti|*dʰé-dʰeh₁-ti}}. {{doublet|ru|бути́к}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|апте́ка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-аптека.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-аптека.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|апте́ка|adj=апте́чный|dim=апте́чка}}

# [[chemist]] {{gloss|store}}; [[drugstore]]; [[pharmacy]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=2005|author=w:ru:[[Кузнецов, Сергей Юрьевич|Сергей Кузнецов]]<t:{{w|Sergey Kuznetsov (writer)|Sergey Kuznetsov}}>|title=Шкурка бабочки|chapter=46|location=Москва|publisher=w:ru:Эксмо|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Andrew Bromfield|title2=Butterfly Skin|location2=London|publisher2=w:[[Titan Publishing Group|Titan Books]]|year2=2014|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Я спуска́лся по ле́стнице торопли́во, как больно́й, кото́рый спеши́т к откры́тию '''апте́ки'''.|t=I walked hastily down the steps, like a sick man hurrying to get to the '''pharmacy''' when it opens.}}

